## 6. 使用组件

```vue
<script setup lang="ts">
import { Button } from '@/components/ui/button'
import {
  Card,
  CardContent,
  CardDescription,
  CardFooter,
  CardHeader,
  CardTitle,
} from '@/components/ui/card'
</script>

<template>
  <Card class="w-80">
    <CardHeader>
      <CardTitle>标题</CardTitle>
      <CardDescription>描述文字</CardDescription>
    </CardHeader>
    <CardContent>
      <p>内容区域</p>
    </CardContent>
    <CardFooter>
      <Button variant="outline">取消</Button>
      <Button>提交</Button>
    </CardFooter>
  </Card>
</template>
```

